  "description": "In order to pay off his mother’s crushing debt, Woo Min-Jo finds himself delivering coffee in high heels to a construction firm run by the notorious gangster, Chu Gio. What starts as a misfortune spirals into a bizarre fate, as Gio quickly takes an interest in Min-Jo. And before he knows it, Min-Jo goes from a broke errand boy to the unlikely “bride” of a thug...!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
